; test_rpc, test_fb_layout and test_page_entry check, with no GPU, what the
; path writes and reads in NVIDIA's formats: the GSP's records, calls and CPU
; sequences, the region its boot reserves and the page-table entries. They go
; through the library's private Rpc, Fb_layout and Page_entry and the layouts
; these read, copied here.

